    "test": "ui_egui::tests::egui_refreshes_and_previews_an_external_note_without_changing_its_tree",
    "change": "Keep the note picker compact and add accessible Previous note and Next note controls so the refreshed Markdown list can be navigated through rendered native UI controls.",
    "checks": [
      "After the production refresh adds Notes/External.md, the UI test selects it using the Previous note button from Notes/Welcome.md; it no longer assigns the selected path through harness state.",
      "The selected external note preview retains its exact UTF-8 BOM and CRLF bytes, and the full vault plus separate app-data snapshots remain unchanged after preview, close, and no-op teardown.",
      "The pre-existing integrated link/rename interaction still reaches its rename preview after the note-navigation control is added."
    ]
  },
